---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate initialization parameters
    q_validate_params --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate_params --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_check_timing --> q_check_addresses: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing constraints violated
    q_check_addresses --> q_check_fees: bidToken != address(0) AND askToken != address(0) AND projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_check_fees --> q_set_config: fee bps values valid
    q_check_fees --> q_revert_fees: invalid fee configuration
    q_set_config --> q_set_timing: tokenPrice = _tokenPrice, bidToken = _bidToken, askToken = _askToken
    q_set_timing --> q_set_addresses: prefundStartTime = _prefundStartTime, startTime = _startTime, endTime = _endTime, refundEndTime = _refundEndTime
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_fees: projectAdmin = _projectAdmin, addressRegistry = _addressRegistry
    q_set_fees --> [*]: legionFee = _legionFee, referrerFee = _referrerFee
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTiming
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_revert_fees --> [*]: revert InvalidFeeConfig

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-001: All timing parameters must be strictly ordered
        INV-002: Duration ranges enforced (prefund 1h-12w, allocation 1h-2w, sale 1h-12w, refund 1h-2w)
    end note
